# AWK: POSIX.1-2024 awk utility description and The GNU Awk User's Guide; requirements/languages/awk.md
name     awk gawk mawk nawk

keyword  BEGIN END BEGINFILE ENDFILE function func if else while for do break continue next nextfile
keyword  exit return delete in getline print printf
builtin  length substr index split sub gsub match sprintf tolower toupper system close srand rand int
builtin  sqrt exp log sin cos atan2 NR NF FNR FS OFS RS ORS FILENAME SUBSEP RSTART RLENGTH ENVIRON ARGC
builtin  ARGV

line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
escape        : octal=3
operators  +-*/%^!<>=?:~|&$
calls
regex
